{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tiled_bridge", "label": "Tiled \u2192 Atlas bridge", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Data-driven redesign of the existing app-local proto: takes a Tiled .tmj export and builds the scene from existing gameplay bricks; prerequisite for the tilemap-collision feature."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tileddocument", "label": "TiledDocument (pure parse layer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Knows nothing of ECS, assets or Vite \u2014 pure parsing, unit-testable without a GPU; absorbs the old MapLoader/LayerManager/TileSetManager/MapObjectManager/MapObjectBuilder."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_mapbuilder", "label": "MapBuilder (ECS instantiation layer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Orchestrates the ECS side (Grid + TileMap children + sprite entities) while staying policy-free: asset URL resolution and sorting policy are injected by the app."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_resolvegid", "label": "resolveGid \u2014 flip-flag masking", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The top 3 bits of a Tiled gid encode H/V/diagonal flips and make the number look negative, so the raw value must go through >>> 0 before masking; diagonal flip is masked but not applied in v1."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_row_flip", "label": "Tiled\u2194Atlas row-flip", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tiled numbers tiles top\u2192bottom (local id 0 = top-left) while Atlas addresses them bottom\u2192top, so localIndex = (rows-1-tiledRow)*columns+col with rows = tileCount/columns. The proto used columns as the base, which is only correct for square tilesets."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tiledassetresolver", "label": "TiledAssetResolver (import.meta.glob)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The JSON `image` field is a runtime string, not a module, so Vite never rewrites it to the bundled hashed URL \u2192 404 in prod. Matching is on `image` (tied to the file on disk), not `name` (an editable display label)."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_groupnamesortingresolver", "label": "groupNameSortingResolver", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Convention over configuration: walk groupPath inside-out and take the first case-insensitive match against the declared sorting layers, with an explicit override map and a warned fallback."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_builtmap", "label": "BuiltMap result", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Returns grid, tile-layer entities, object entities, collider data and named points already in WORLD coordinates, so ArenaScene no longer multiplies the spawn point by MAP_SCALE."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_mapcollider", "label": "MapCollider (data-only rect)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_data_only_collision", "label": "Data-only collision decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No Collider2D/RigidBody2D is spawned by the bridge; shapes are only exposed so the following tilemap-collision feature owns that decision, keeping this task's scope closed."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tile_objects_ysort", "label": "Tile-objects as Y-sorted entities", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Y-sort is per-entity, not per-tile: a whole TileMap shares one worldY, so anything that must interleave with the player (occluders like trees) MUST be a tile-object, never a tile layer. Sprites are anchored at their base so worldY is the feet."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_multi_tileset_split", "label": "Multi-tileset layer split", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One Tiled layer becomes N TileMap children (one per tileset used), replacing the proto's fragile '1 Tiled tileset = 1 gameplay layer matched by name' assumption; yields one instanced draw call per (layer \u00d7 tileset)."}, {"id": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_pure_parse_boundary", "label": "Parse/ECS boundary principle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeping the Vite and policy pieces as injected seams is exactly what would later allow extracting the bridge into an @atlasjs/tiled engine package without dragging import.meta.glob along."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_mapbuilder", "target": "docs_assets_asset_system_assetmanager", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tiled_bridge", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tileddocument", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tiled_bridge", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_mapbuilder", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_pure_parse_boundary", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tileddocument", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tileddocument", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_resolvegid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tileddocument", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_row_flip", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/dino-brawl-tiled-bridge.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_mapbuilder", "target": "docs_dino_brawl_tiled_bridge_tileddocument", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EX